@ 6.2.2.1.17 - Classical Arabic to Tunisian Arabic
# citation: Pogostick Man, from http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tunisian_Arabic
	a > ɑ / near emphatics
	a > ɛ
	dˤ q > ðˤ {ɡ,q}
	dʒ x ɣ > ʒ χ ʁ
	aj aw > {aj,e:[+ long],i:[+ long] aw,o:[+ long],u:[+ long]}
	V:[+ long] > V:[-long] / _# (except as below)
	V(ː) > V:[+ long] / in accented or stressed monosyllables